# MoE-Lens — ODS integration analysis

## Executive summary

MoE-Lens is more valuable to ODS as a performance-modeling and hardware/runtime design reference than as an inference server.

**ODS classification: P1 — architecture and modeling reference.**

## ODS fit

Its value is in understanding how model structure, workload, hardware and memory hierarchy influence execution time.

This can feed the ODS capability registry and runtime selector, helping distinguish estimates from measured evidence.

It should not be installed as the production inference backend.